    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000u1kv](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000u1kv) Magnitude 6.2 earthquake at 53.473 depth occurred on Oct 11 2026 20km W of Ballalae Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.0062 longitude 155.7021. It impacted 29565 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
